---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
	title="How This Site Is Tested | Zlata Popelnuh"
	description="Explore the test pyramid, CI/CD quality gates, live Playwright monitoring, and AI-assisted engineering guardrails behind this portfolio."
>
	<section class="quality-page" aria-label="Quality engineering overview" data-testid="quality-page">
		<header class="quality-hero">
			<p class="eyebrow">QUALITY ENGINEERING · TEST ARCHITECTURE</p>
			<h1 data-testid="quality-heading">How This Site Is Tested</h1>
			<p class="intro">
				This portfolio doubles as a live reference implementation of a production test pyramid,
				CI/CD quality gates, and synthetic monitoring—so the engineering practices behind the
				site are visible as well as the results.
			</p>
		</header>

		<section class="status-strip" aria-label="Live quality status" data-testid="quality-status">
			<div class="status-badges" aria-label="Workflow status badges">
				<a
					href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/actions/workflows/azure-static-web-apps-salmon-water-0ad7f5510.yml"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					aria-label="CI/CD workflow status"
					data-testid="quality-cicd-badge"
				>
					<img
						src="https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/azure-static-web-apps-salmon-water-0ad7f5510.yml?branch=main&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=CI%2FCD&amp;labelColor=0f172a&amp;color=10b981"
						alt="CI/CD status"
						height="20"
					/>
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/actions/workflows/unit-tests.yml"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					aria-label="Unit tests workflow status"
					data-testid="quality-unit-badge"
				>
					<img
						src="https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/unit-tests.yml?branch=main&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=Unit%20Tests&amp;labelColor=0f172a&amp;color=10b981"
						alt="Unit tests status"
						height="20"
					/>
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/actions/workflows/scheduled-e2e.yml"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					aria-label="Live E2E workflow status"
					data-testid="quality-live-e2e-badge"
				>
					<img
						src="https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/scheduled-e2e.yml?branch=main&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=Live%20E2E&amp;labelColor=0f172a&amp;color=10b981"
						alt="Live E2E status"
						height="20"
					/>
				</a>
				<a
					href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/actions/workflows/security-scan.yml"
					target="_blank"
					rel="noopener noreferrer"
					aria-label="Security scan workflow status"
					data-testid="quality-security-badge"
				>
					<img
						src="https://img.shields.io/github/actions/workflow/status/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/security-scan.yml?branch=main&amp;style=flat-square&amp;label=Security&amp;labelColor=0f172a&amp;color=10b981"
						alt="Security status"
						height="20"
					/>
				</a>
			</div>
			<a
				class="report-link"
				href="https://popelnuh.github.io/popelnuh-portfolio/"
				target="_blank"
				rel="noopener noreferrer"
				data-testid="quality-report-link"
			>
				Latest Playwright report
				<svg aria-hidden="true" focusable="false" viewBox="0 0 20 20">
					<path
						d="M4.167 10h11.666m-5-5 5 5-5 5"
						fill="none"
						stroke="currentColor"
						stroke-linecap="round"
						stroke-linejoin="round"
						stroke-width="1.7"
					/>
				</svg>
			</a>
		</section>

		<section class="quality-section" aria-labelledby="pyramid-heading">
			<div class="section-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">01 / VERIFICATION</p>
				<h2 id="pyramid-heading">The Test Pyramid</h2>
			</div>
			<div class="test-grid">
				<article class="detail-card">
					<p class="card-tag">FAST · DETERMINISTIC</p>
					<h3>Unit &amp; Contract Tests <span>(Vitest)</span></h3>
					<p>
						Pure TypeScript logic is tested in isolation: URL deep-link state in
						<code>src/lib/urlState.ts</code>, dataset helpers, and data contracts. These focused
						checks run in milliseconds and catch regressions on every push.
					</p>
				</article>
				<article class="detail-card">
					<p class="card-tag">USER JOURNEYS · BDD</p>
					<h3>End-to-End &amp; BDD Tests <span>(Playwright)</span></h3>
					<p>
						Gherkin <code>.feature</code> specifications, Page Object Models, and web-first
						assertions exercise real journeys across Home, About, Blog, and interactive Leaflet
						maps.
					</p>
				</article>
			</div>
		</section>

		<section class="quality-section" aria-labelledby="pipelines-heading">
			<div class="section-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">02 / DELIVERY</p>
				<h2 id="pipelines-heading">CI/CD &amp; Synthetic Monitoring</h2>
			</div>
			<ol class="pipeline-list">
				<li class="pipeline-card" data-testid="quality-unit-pipeline">
					<h3>Pull request &amp; push quality gates</h3>
					<p>
						The{' '}
						<a href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/blob/main/.github/workflows/unit-tests.yml"
							>unit tests workflow</a
						>{' '}
						runs Vitest and test linting. The deployment workflow also runs unit and Playwright
						tests before publishing changes.
					</p>
				</li>
				<li class="pipeline-card" data-testid="quality-azure-pipeline">
					<h3>Azure Static Web Apps</h3>
					<p>
						The{' '}
						<a
							href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/blob/main/.github/workflows/azure-static-web-apps-salmon-water-0ad7f5510.yml"
							>Azure deployment workflow</a
						>
						{' '}builds and deploys the static site after its quality checks pass.
					</p>
				</li>
				<li class="pipeline-card" data-testid="quality-live-pipeline">
					<h3>Daily live-site checks</h3>
					<p>
						The{' '}
						<a
							href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/blob/main/.github/workflows/scheduled-e2e.yml"
							>scheduled E2E workflow</a
						>
						{' '}runs Playwright daily against{' '}
						<a href="https://www.popelnuh.com">popelnuh.com</a>{' '}
						and publishes each HTML report to GitHub Pages.
					</p>
				</li>
				<li class="pipeline-card" data-testid="quality-security-pipeline">
					<h3>Weekly security scan</h3>
					<p>
						The{' '}
						<a
							href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/blob/main/.github/workflows/security-scan.yml"
							>Security Scan workflow</a
						>
						{' '}runs <code>npm audit</code> and OWASP ZAP Baseline DAST against the live site.
					</p>
				</li>
			</ol>
		</section>

		<section class="quality-section guardrails" aria-labelledby="guardrails-heading">
			<div class="section-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">03 / RESPONSIBLE AUTOMATION</p>
				<h2 id="guardrails-heading">AI-Assisted Engineering Guardrails</h2>
			</div>
			<p>
				<code>AGENTS.md</code> defines the project's engineering boundaries: keep UI selectors and
				browser interactions in Page Objects, use semantic locators, and assert user-visible
				outcomes. Deterministic unit contracts and end-to-end suites provide repeatable verification
				when coding agents or Playwright CLI assist with changes.
			</p>
		</section>

		<section class="quality-section code-section" aria-labelledby="code-heading">
			<div class="section-heading">
				<p class="eyebrow">04 / TRANSPARENCY</p>
				<h2 id="code-heading">Inspect the Code</h2>
			</div>
			<ul class="code-links" data-testid="quality-code-links">
				<li>
					<a
						href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/blob/main/AGENTS.md"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						data-testid="quality-code-agents">AGENTS.md</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a
						href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/blob/main/playwright.config.ts"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						data-testid="quality-code-config">playwright.config.ts</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a
						href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/tree/main/tests/features"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						data-testid="quality-code-features">tests/features/</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a
						href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/tree/main/tests/pages"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						data-testid="quality-code-pages">tests/pages/</a
					>
				</li>
				<li>
					<a
						href="https://github.com/popelnuh/popelnuh-portfolio/tree/main/.github/workflows"
						target="_blank"
						rel="noopener noreferrer"
						data-testid="quality-code-workflows">.github/workflows/</a
					>
				</li>
			</ul>
		</section>
	</section>
</Layout>

<style>
	.quality-page {
		padding: 72px 0 80px;
	}

	.quality-hero {
		max-width: 780px;
		margin-bottom: 32px;
	}

	.eyebrow,
	.card-tag {
		color: var(--accent-muted);
		font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono',
			'Courier New', monospace;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: 0.08em;
	}

	.eyebrow {
		margin: 0 0 10px;
	}

	h1 {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 7vw, 4.5rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.05em;
		line-height: 1.05;
		text-wrap: balance;
	}

	.intro {
		margin: 20px 0 0;
		color: var(--text-body);
		font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	.status-strip {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 16px;
		padding: 18px 20px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: white;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
	}

	.status-badges {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		align-items: center;
		gap: 10px;
	}

	.status-badges a {
		display: inline-flex;
		align-items: center;
		line-height: 0;
	}

	.status-badges img {
		display: block;
		width: auto;
		height: 20px;
		max-width: 100%;
	}

	.report-link {
		display: inline-flex;
		min-height: 42px;
		align-items: center;
		justify-content: center;
		gap: 8px;
		padding: 9px 14px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: var(--accent);
		color: white;
		font-size: 0.9rem;
		font-weight: 700;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: background-color 160ms ease, transform 160ms ease;
	}

	.report-link:hover {
		transform: translateY(-1px);
		background: var(--accent-hover);
	}

	.report-link:focus-visible,
	.code-links a:focus-visible,
	.pipeline-card a:focus-visible {
		outline: 3px solid rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.28);
		outline-offset: 3px;
	}

	.report-link svg {
		width: 17px;
		height: 17px;
	}

	.quality-section {
		margin-top: 58px;
	}

	.section-heading {
		margin-bottom: 18px;
	}

	.section-heading h2 {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		font-size: clamp(1.65rem, 4vw, 2.2rem);
		letter-spacing: -0.04em;
		line-height: 1.2;
	}

	.test-grid {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 18px;
	}

	.detail-card,
	.pipeline-card {
		padding: 22px 24px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-radius: 12px;
		background: white;
		box-shadow: 0 10px 24px rgba(15, 23, 42, 0.04);
	}

	.detail-card {
		border-top: 3px solid var(--accent);
	}

	.card-tag {
		margin: 0 0 10px;
		font-size: 0.68rem;
	}

	.detail-card h3,
	.pipeline-card h3 {
		margin: 0 0 10px;
		color: var(--text-primary);
		font-size: 1.08rem;
		line-height: 1.4;
	}

	.detail-card h3 span {
		color: var(--accent-muted);
		font-size: 0.92em;
		font-weight: 600;
	}

	.detail-card p:last-child,
	.pipeline-card p,
	.guardrails > p:last-child {
		margin: 0;
		color: var(--text-body);
		font-size: 0.95rem;
		line-height: 1.7;
	}

	code {
		padding: 0.08em 0.3em;
		border-radius: 4px;
		background: var(--accent-soft);
		color: var(--accent);
		font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono',
			'Courier New', monospace;
		font-size: 0.88em;
	}

	.pipeline-list {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(3, minmax(0, 1fr));
		gap: 16px;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.pipeline-card {
		padding: 20px;
	}

	.pipeline-card a {
		color: var(--accent);
		font-weight: 650;
		text-decoration-color: var(--border-subtle);
		text-underline-offset: 2px;
	}

	.pipeline-card a:hover {
		color: var(--accent-hover);
		text-decoration-color: currentColor;
	}

	.guardrails {
		padding: 24px 26px;
		border-left: 3px solid var(--accent);
		border-radius: 0 12px 12px 0;
		background: var(--accent-soft);
	}

	.guardrails .section-heading {
		margin-bottom: 12px;
	}

	.code-links {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(180px, 1fr));
		gap: 10px;
		margin: 0;
		padding: 0;
		list-style: none;
	}

	.code-links a {
		display: block;
		padding: 13px 15px;
		border: 1px solid var(--border-subtle);
		border-radius: 8px;
		background: white;
		color: var(--text-body);
		font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Monaco, Consolas, 'Liberation Mono',
			'Courier New', monospace;
		font-size: 0.87rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		text-decoration: none;
		transition: border-color 160ms ease, color 160ms ease;
	}

	.code-links a:hover {
		border-color: var(--accent);
		color: var(--accent);
	}

	@media (max-width: 760px) {
		.quality-page {
			padding: 56px 0 64px;
		}

		.test-grid,
		.pipeline-list {
			grid-template-columns: 1fr;
		}

		.quality-section {
			margin-top: 44px;
		}

		.status-strip {
			align-items: flex-start;
		}
	}

	@media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) {
		.report-link,
		.code-links a {
			transition: none;
		}

		.report-link:hover {
			transform: none;
		}
	}
</style>
